00:02:16.261 --> 00:02:19.599
I wanted to make it and I was going to make
it regardless of what anybody said.

00:02:19.599 --> 00:02:22.080
I don't know how I would describe my flow.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:29.140
I think that I developed a flow from so many
other different artists.

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:36.549
Like, I was inspired by like I would have
to say like early on LL, Beastie Boys, Run

00:02:36.549 --> 00:02:47.319
