00:02:47.319 --> 00:02:49.459
Treach from Naughty By Nature.

00:02:49.459 --> 00:02:56.430
So I was a student of hip-hop so I watched,
I studied what everybody did in the game and

00:02:56.430 --> 00:03:02.090
just try to develop my own kind of sound and
it took me a long time to get but I just kind

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:06.769
